### 25FF411 – Dragon (requested term)

mdhn:iconclass25FF411 a mdhn:IconclassTerm ;
    rdfs:label "dragon"@en ,
               "اژدها"@fa ;
    
    rdfs:comment """Official Iconclass notation 25FF411: dragon.
    Use this for the four-legged / lizard-like dragon.
