    the ark is floating on the waters, while life on earth is destroyed ~ story of Noah.
    This is the primary official term for scenes showing Noah and his family 
    visible on the deck (or at the windows) of the ark during the Flood."""@en ;
    mdhn:isInExtendedScope "false"^^xsd:boolean ;
